ordsman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16748"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【世界の運命を握る剣士】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職種：パラディン"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好き：好き嫌いは特にない。エリスの料理が好物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"森の奥で、伝説のヴァルキリーが何者かと戦う姿を目撃する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不運にもそれに巻き込まれ一度は命を落とすが、ヴァルキリーによって蘇生の術を受ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして彼女が仕える愛の女神の代行者として、剣を手に戦乱の中へ身を置くこととなるのだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13151","sourceWorkId":"11925","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"森の奥で、伝説のヴァルキリーが何者かと戦う姿を目撃する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不運にもそれに巻き込まれ一度は命を落とすが、ヴァルキリーによって蘇生の術を受ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして彼女が仕える愛の女神の代行者として、剣を手に戦乱の中へ身を置くこととなるのだが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「僕は自分の仲間達が生きるこの世界を、戦乱の渦に巻き込みたくないだけだ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62703"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62703","value":"好き嫌いは特にない、エリスの料理が好物。"},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13151","sourceWorkId":"11925","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"58 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13151","sourceWorkId":"11925","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/8272515f96972d0b760afb39969501b1e4064a274ec757b49b1ea6fca13cf4bf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e834f5487d6b16acc03a37d260594be20fc519ec5eb48e1ee0749f6a1d8c3ec.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c16749","characterName":"エリス・リチュアル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62706","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"15964"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13163"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16749"},"originalCharacterName":"エリス・リチュアル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"142"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"42"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Character Design - Chikotamu (ちこたむ)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eris is a healer and Leo's younger sister who had harbored a secret love for him for many years. She is good at cooking and is a mood maker."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the Japanese Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16749"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃よりレオと共に育ってきた、典型的なお兄ちゃんっ子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅の仲間の回復を一手に引き受けるヒーラーであり、ムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おまけに料理も得意と、よくできた義妹。長年内に秘めた想いと共に、レオの戦いに同行する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13163","sourceWorkId":"11925","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃よりレオと共に育ってきた、典型的なお兄ちゃんっ子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅の仲間の回復を一手に引き受けるヒーラーであり、ムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おまけに料理も得意と、よくできた義妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長年内に秘めた想いと共に、レオの戦いに同行する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私はお兄ちゃんを信じる！　愛する者を信じる心こそ真の力になるってフィリーヤ様が言っていた。それが私の戦い！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62706"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62706","value":"家事全般、子供の世話"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62706","value":"不誠実な人、不潔な人、ロキ"},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"142 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13163","sourceWorkId":"11925","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"42 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13163","sourceWorkId":"11925","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be3f81a9ad07d419394dfc165b45040c827159cc5c4ae54b6e2c4439da8d534b.webp","f